@title Cabinet: the Arrange tools preview first, Cancel stores nothing, Accept is one undo step
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Written without a run (no display on the authoring box): check the pictures on the first run.
# On the plan qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo the Arrange entry of the Cabinet left rail (also Ctrl K:
# "autodistance", "autogroup", "auto rails", "auto ducts") shows a preview banner naming the tool;
# Esc cancels it; Accept stores it; Ctrl+Z takes it back in one step.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot before
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text autogroup
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Preview (Autogroup)"
shot group-preview
key Escape
wait 5
shot group-cancelled
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text close up gaps
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Preview (Autodistance"
shot tight-preview
key Enter
wait 10
shot tight-accepted
check_layout
key ctrl+z
wait 10
shot tight-undone
